57
00:08:15,786 --> 00:08:17,955
Ayah pandai menggoreng telur.

58
00:08:18,039 --> 00:08:19,790
Aku pandai mencuci piring.

59
00:08:19,874 --> 00:08:22,335
Ayah bilang kita harus melakukan
