74
00:09:48,504 --> 00:09:49,630
Ayo berangkat.

75
00:10:37,887 --> 00:10:40,389
Pekan lalu, dia terluka
saat bekerja di pabrik,

76
00:10:40,473 --> 00:10:43,309
tapi dia tak berobat ke dokter
dan hanya diam di rumah.

77
00:10:43,392 --> 00:10:45,811
Menurut dokter yang datang bersama polisi,

78
00:10:45,895 --> 00:10:48,564
