88
00:11:13,005 --> 00:11:13,839
Ya.

89
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:17,009
Kami lihat dulu, baru mencari solusinya.

90
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:19,637
Baiklah. Tolong cepat.

91
00:11:55,548 --> 00:11:56,632
Pak Kim Seon-u.

92
00:11:57,383 --> 00:12:00,678
Kau wafat pada tanggal 11 April 2020.

93
00:12:01,804 --> 00:12:02,680
Aku…

94
00:12:02,763 --> 00:12:04,974
Han Jeong-u dari Move to Heaven.

95
00:12:05,808 --> 00:12:06,976
Aku Han Geu-ru.

96
00:12:08,561 --> 00:12:12,022
Kami akan memulai
proses pindahan terakhirmu.

97
00:13:20,132 --> 00:13:21,550
JIN RAMEN

98
00:13:36,774 --> 00:13:40,194
MINIMARKET CU

99
00:13:58,379 --> 00:13:59,213
Ayah.

100
00:14:01,382 --> 00:14:04,051
Ayah memikirkan mendiang lagi?

101
00:14:04,635 --> 00:14:05,469
Ya.

102
00:14:07,179 --> 00:14:09,765
Orang seperti apa Pak Kim Seon-u?

103
00:14:10,391 --> 00:14:12,643
Dia adalah pemuda

104
00:14:12,726 --> 00:14:15,479
