Jika tak begitu,

220
00:26:25,667 --> 00:26:29,087
mereka pasti akan membuat keributan
dan beberapa dari kita dipecat.

221
00:26:29,170 --> 00:26:30,672
Mau pergi sekarang?

222
00:26:31,756 --> 00:26:34,634
Biasanya orang tua meraung-raung
saat kehilangan anaknya.

223
00:26:34,718 --> 00:26:36,845
Pemakaman setenang ini jarang terjadi.

224
00:26:36,928 --> 00:26:38,638
Kita harus bersyukur

225
00:26:39,431 --> 00:26:41,975
karena mereka bisu.

226
00:26:42,642 --> 00:26:43,977
Minumlah.

227
00:26:46,229 --> 00:26:47,105
Ada apa?

228
00:26:49,482 --> 00:26:50,609
Tunggu Ayah di luar, ya?

229
00:26:52,027 --> 00:26:53,653
Geu-ru.

230
00:26:54,154 --> 00:26:54,988
Baik.

231
00:27:01,119 --> 00:27:02,329
