275
00:30:26,658 --> 00:30:27,492
Itu.

276
00:30:27,951 --> 00:30:29,202
Aku sangat menginginkannya.

277
00:30:35,583 --> 00:30:38,670
Rajidae, Rajiformes,
Chondrichthyes, Chordata.

278
00:30:38,753 --> 00:30:40,839
- Kami di ruang tunggu.
- Mulutnya menonjol,

279
00:30:40,922 --> 00:30:43,174
